# Pairs with GateOwnership. A split that never takes its gate races every capture split of the same leaf.
MODULE: ForegroundSkipsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreground split proceeds without taking B's split gate
PERTURBS: BeginForeground

--- FIND
    /\ Admits("B", TRUE)
    /\ fg' = "gate"
--- REPLACE
    /\ Admits("B", TRUE)
    \* MUTATION: the split gate is skipped
    /\ fg' = "sib"
--- END
